/// Passes a String where the project stub declares an Integer. The stub is
/// the only type source for `parity_lint_stub_ffi`, so the mismatch is
/// reported only by a surface that merges the `stubs/` tier.
Object subclass: Caller

  /// A `Type` warning: a live-recheck failure under `--warnings-as-errors`.
  mismatch => Erlang parity_lint_stub_ffi double: "text"
